OL,3,GNEWSAIsland Energy: No plans to remove
OL,4,Agas standing charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company which provides energy to
OL,7,Fhouseholds on the Isle of Man said it
OL,8,Fhas no plans to change the charging
OL,9,Fstructure, following announcements in
OL,10,Fthe UK Autumn Budget regarding the
OL,11,Fremoval of standing charges.
OL,13,FOn Wednesday, Chancellor John Healy
OL,14,Fannounced the removal of standing
OL,15,Fcharges - fixed daily fees paid
OL,16,Fregardless of usage - from household
OL,17,Fgas bills in England, Scotland and
OL,18,FWales, with costs added to the unit
OL,19,Frate instead.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
